  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/m_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:100/60\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">땅을 \n                            팔려면 삽자루나 곡괭이같은 도구가 필요합니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이러한 \n                            도구들은 팅거스킬이나 도구점에서 얻을 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측에 \n                            곡괭이는 약102번 삽자루는 51번을 캘 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/m_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:100/60\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">삽자루를 \n                            더블클릭후 타겟이 뜨면 원하시는 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">땅을 \n                            찍어 주시면됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\">\n<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(</span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20040618003641/http://forg.co.kr:80/newbie/mining.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#990066\" face=\"Verdana\">Flash-초보자가이드</font></a></b></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/m_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:100/60\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일단 \n                            광물을 얻게되면 좌측 그림처럼 포지를 이용하여</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">원하시는 \n                            잉갓을 얻을 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\">\n<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(</span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20040618003641/http://forg.co.kr:80/newbie/mining_moving.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#990066\" face=\"Verdana\">Flash-초보자가이드</font></a></b></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/m_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:100/60\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측사진처럼 \n                            광물을 더블클릭하여 타겟이 뜨면 포지를 클릭하여</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">우측의 \n                            잉갓을 얻을 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">높은 \n                            스킬이 요구되는 광물일수록 녹일 때 실패율도 큽니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 해상광산</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/m_5.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"130\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/130\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/m_6.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:100/100\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일명 \n                            해상광산이라고 하는 것으로 배를 타고</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">광석을 \n                            채취하는 방법입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">위에 \n                            그림처럼 미녹북쪽,코브,셔펜홀드지역에 있고</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                            T2A지역에도 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">예전 \n                            피케이가 광산에서 끊임없이 출몰하였을 때는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">광물을 \n                            얻기에 더없이 좋은 장소 였습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"501\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"8\" width=\"495\">\n<p><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 스킬별 \n                            색잉갓 획득</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잉갓</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">갑옷</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"57\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">색깔</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잉갓</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"42\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">갑옷</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"93\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">색깔</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"54\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#105085\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/ingot_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/ingot.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"57\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일반잉갓</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/dull_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"42\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/dull.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"93\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">덜쿠퍼</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"54\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">65</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/shadow_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/shadow.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"57\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">쉐도우</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/cooper.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"42\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/gold.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"93\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구리</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"54\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">75</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/bronze_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/bronze.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"57\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">청동</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">80</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/gold_ingot.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"42\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/gold_1.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"93\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">골드</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"54\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">85</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/agapite_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/agapite.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"57\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아가파이트(아가)</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">90</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/vet_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"42\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/vet.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"93\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">베리테</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"54\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">95</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/val_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/val.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"57\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">발로라이트(발로)</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">99</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"251\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">만든갑옷을 \n                            녹여서 다시 잉갓으로 환원하는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬은 \n                                        스미스가아닌 \n                            마이닝이기</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">때문에 \n                                        스킬이 높을수록 잉갓환원이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;더 \n                                        많이 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"499\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 가고일곡괭이<a name=\"가고일\"></a></span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"130\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/130\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">윈드던전 \n                            또는 히스로스또는 숲주변에 가고일과스톤가고일이 \n                            있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이것을 \n                            잡게되면 운좋을 때는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가고일의 \n                            곡괭이를 얻을 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/100\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측의 \n                            사진은 가고일의 곡괭이 입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가고일의 \n                            곡괭이를 가지고 원하는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">광산의 \n                            포인트에서 땅을 파게되면</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">여러 \n                            가지 엘리멘탈이 나오게됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/100\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일반잉갓이상의 \n                            엘리가 나옵니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">:일반잉갓포인트는 \n                            덜쿠퍼엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아가파이트포인트는 \n                            베리테엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">베리테포인트는 \n                            발로엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">발로포인트는 \n                             발로엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">총 \n                            8개종류의 엘리멘탈이 나옵니다</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:250/100\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">각엘리멘탈은 \n                            특수능력을 지니고 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">발로엘리의 \n                            경우는 물리적데미지만 받습니다. 전사와광부의파티가 \n                            효과적입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 테이머의용도 안됩니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">오직 \n                            전사^^</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:0px;\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written \n                By Forg</span></font></b></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-heig